Use the system unzip for the pinned Electron runtime archive. extract-zip
can leave its promise unresolved and Node exits successfully after extracting
only the first entry in the native arm64 validation environment.

See https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/63487 and
https://github.com/electron/electron/issues/51619.

